  "description": "A pixel-faithful retro enterprise (classic SAP GUI / Windows 9x) theme and control library for WPF: 1px two-tone bevels, MS Sans Serif type, steel-blue chrome with amber selection. Restyles all standard WPF controls and adds RetroWindow, Bevel, ToggleSwitch, Tag, MessageStrip, Badge, Avatar, Breadcrumb, Pagination, FormField, Timeline, EmptyState, RetroMessageBox and a 44-icon pixel icon set.",
